<title>USA: EIA Weekly U.S. Propane Inventory Report.</title>
<headline>EIA Weekly U.S. Propane Inventory Report.</headline>
<text>
<p>U.S. PROPANE STOCKS (IN MILLION BARRELS)</p>
<p>		12/06/96    11/29/96   12/95     11/95  Change/Wk</p>
<p>East Coast	 4.8	 4.8	4.6	 4.7	 0.0</p>
<p>Midwest	   14.7	15.2     20.6	 21.0    - 0.5</p>
<p>Gulf Coast	23.1	23.3     22.7	 23.9    - 0.2</p>
<p>U.S. Total	44.2	44.8     49.6	 51.7    - 0.6</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>Source: Estimates by U.S. Department of Energy's Energy Information Administration. EIA will report propane stocks on a weekly basis from October to May.</p>
<p>- Totals may not equal sum of regions due to rounding.</p>
</text>
